"description":"","creator":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":82,"state":"open","created_at":"2012-09-12T10:39:07Z","updated_at":"2018-07-29T21:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2014-03-13T11:33:00Z","updated_at":"2014-03-30T21:40:17Z","closed_at":"2014-03-15T21:01:35Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When I compile a .cu-file using nvcc and cuda.h is _not_ included, compilation fails.\nA very simple example:\n\n<b>test.cu:</b>\n\n``` cpp\n#include <glm/glm.hpp>\n\nint main (void)\n{\n        return 0;\n}\n```\n\n<pre>\n$ nvcc test.cu -I/opt/glm-0.9.5\nIn file included from /opt/glm-0.9.5/glm/detail/type_int.hpp:32:0,\n                 from /opt/glm-0.9.5/glm/fwd.hpp:32,\n                 from /opt/glm-0.9.5/glm/glm.hpp:88,\n                 from test.cu:1:\n/opt/glm-0.9.5/glm/detail/setup.hpp:215:4: error: #error \"GLM requires CUDA 3.0 or higher\"\n/opt/glm-0.9.5/glm/detail/setup.hpp:317:2: error: #error \"GLM_COMPILER undefined, your compiler may not be supported by GLM. Add #define GLM_COMPILER 0 to ignore this message.\"\n\n</pre>\n\n\nThe reason for this error is that nvcc does not define <b>CUDA_VERSION</b>, it is only defined if cuda.h is included.\n\n<b>cuda.h</b>\n\n``` cpp\n...\n#define CUDA_VERSION 5050\n...\n```\n\nA solution could be to include cuda.h from setup.hpp:\n<b>setup.hpp</b>\n\n``` cpp\n...\n// CUDA\n#elif defined(__CUDACC__)\n#       include <cuda.h> // make sure this file is included, otherwise CUDA_VERSION will not be defined\n#       if CUDA_VERSION < 3000\n#               error \"GLM requires CUDA 3.0 or higher\"\n#       else\n#               define GLM_COMPILER GLM_COMPILER_CUDA\n#       endif\n...\n```\n\nMy setup: CUDA 5.5, glm 0.9.5\n","closed_by":{"login":"Groovounet","id":367227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NzIyNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/367227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet","html_url":"https://github.com/Groovounet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Groovounet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/g-truc/glm/issues/182/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused